["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/reportedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Designates a `from` /Security/Vulnerability was first reported to a project, vendor, or tracking database for formal identification by each `to` Agent.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
